// One bit of RAM: while S (select) and W (write) are on it takes D; Q
// shows it while S is on.
name Memory bit
port d D in
port w W in
port s S in
port q Q out
alu U stone
chip U 0 AND
chip U 1 D latch
chip U 2 AND
wire U in:S 0:A
wire U in:N 0:B
wire U in:W 1:D
wire U 0:Q 1:E
wire U 1:Q 2:A
wire U in:S 2:B
wire U 2:Q out:E
layer
..w.
..-.
d-Uq
..-.
..s.
